= Philosophy =
Philosophy examines foundational questions about reality, knowledge, value, reasoning, mind, ethics, and meaning.

== BITwiki lenses ==
BITwiki gives special attention to ontology, epistemology, axiology, philosophy of science, systems thinking, cybernetics, and historically influential metaphysical or esoteric traditions when they are clearly separated from empirical claims.

